    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d549">

                <pb facs="0613" n="595" sameAs="frus:frus1946v11/pg595"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">825.51/9–1046</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by Mr. Louis Lister of the Minerals
                        Section, Division of International Resources, to the Chief of the
                        Division</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Lipkowitz</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-09-10">September 10, 1946</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Mr. Stenger,<anchor n="94" xml:id="d549-f1"/> ED, has given me the following
                    information regarding Chile’s request for an Eximbank loan. The request is for a
                    $40,000,000 loan, half of which is to be allocated to the Fomento Corp. and the
                    other half to the Chilean State Railways. The funds are allocated to the
                    following groups of industries: <table cols="4" rows="15">
                        <row>
                            <cell><hi rendition="#italic">Fomento Corp</hi>.</cell>
                            <cell><hi rendition="#italic">Millions of Dollars</hi></cell>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Hydroelectric</cell>
                            <cell role="num">5.5</cell>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Petroleum Explorations</cell>
                            <cell role="num">5.0</cell>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Agricultural Machinery Plants</cell>
                            <cell role="num">3.2</cell>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Wood &amp; Lumber Projects</cell>
                            <cell role="num">3.4</cell>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Transportation</cell>
                            <cell role="num">3.6</cell>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Copper Manufacturers</cell>
                            <cell role="num">0.6</cell>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Cement Manufactures</cell>
                            <cell role="num">0.5</cell>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Fish Industry</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#underline" role="num">0.5</cell>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell rend="padding-left: 3em">Total</cell>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell role="num">22.3</cell>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell><hi rendition="#italic">Chilean State Railways</hi></cell>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Rolling Stock</cell>
                            <cell role="num">5.00</cell>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Electrification</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#underline" role="num">16.25</cell>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell rend="padding-left: 3em">Total</cell>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#underline" role="num">21.25</cell>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell rend="padding-left: 4em"><hi rendition="#italic">Grand
                                Total</hi></cell>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#underline" role="num">43.55<anchor n="*"
                                    xml:id="d549-f2"/></cell>
                        </row>
                    </table></p>
                <p>The request is currently before the NAC, which, according to Mr. Stenger, has not
                    yet taken any action.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d549-f1" n="94" xml:id="d549-f1-content">
                <p>Jerome J. Stenger, Special Assistant, Division of Investment and Economic
                    Development.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d549-f2" n="*" xml:id="d549-f2-content">
                <p>Loan requested is for $40,000,000 [Footnote in the original.]</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
